WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.192 --> 00:00:14.197
&gt;&gt; Laura: IF A SOCIETY IS BEST

00:00:11.461 --> 00:00:21.171
JUDGED BY THE QUALITY OF ITS

00:00:14.331 --> 00:00:23.874
MERCY, BRITAIN'S SOCIALIZED

00:00:21.304 --> 00:00:27.377
MEDICAL SYSTEM IS FAILING.

00:00:24.007 --> 00:00:29.045
EIFFEL EVANS IS DYING FROM A

00:00:27.511 --> 00:00:30.981
CONDITION THAT DOCTORS HAVE BEEN

00:00:29.179 --> 00:00:34.618
UNABLE TO DIAGNOSIS.

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:35.452
HE WAS TAKEN OFF A COURT ORDERED

00:00:34.751 --> 00:00:37.521
LIFE SUPPORT.

00:00:35.585 --> 00:00:39.423
HIS FAMILY WANTS TO TAKE HIM TO

00:00:37.654 --> 00:00:41.291
ITALY THAT IS OFFERING HIM AN

00:00:39.556 --> 00:00:41.691
ALTERNATIVE TREATMENT AND

00:00:41.425 --> 00:00:44.561
CITIZENSHIP.

00:00:41.825 --> 00:00:49.199
HERE TO DISCUSS WHAT THIS TELLS

00:00:44.694 --> 00:00:49.499
US ABOUT SOCIALIZED MEDICINE,

00:00:49.332 --> 00:00:51.201
NIGEL.

00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:53.203
THANKS FOR BEING HERE, NIGEL.

00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:55.839
I'VE BEEN PRAYING FOR ALFIE AND

00:00:53.336 --> 00:00:57.407
HIS FAMILY, BUT I HAVE A

00:00:55.972 --> 00:01:00.644
QUESTION FOR YOU TONIGHT.

00:00:57.541 --> 00:01:05.282
HOW CAN COURTS IN THE E.U. AND

00:01:00.777 --> 00:01:07.284
THE U.K. PREVENT A FAMILY FROM

00:01:05.415 --> 00:01:09.920
REMOVING THEIR CHILD FROM A

00:01:07.417 --> 00:01:11.521
HOSPITAL AND TAKING HIM OR HER

00:01:10.053 --> 00:01:11.888
TO ANOTHER COUNTRY FOR

00:01:11.655 --> 00:01:12.689
TREATMENT?

00:01:12.022 --> 00:01:13.089
HOW IS THAT EVEN HAPPEN

00:01:12.823 --> 00:01:14.324
SOMETHING.

00:01:13.223 --> 00:01:16.393
&gt;&gt; WHAT IS HAPPENING HERE IS THE

00:01:14.458 --> 00:01:18.862
RIGHTS OF THE PARENTS TO DO WHAT

00:01:16.526 --> 00:01:19.896
THEY THINK ARE RIGHT ARE BEING

00:01:18.995 --> 00:01:22.065
TAKEN AWAY FROM THEM.

00:01:20.030 --> 00:01:22.599
WE HAVE A CASE HERE -- IT'S NOT

00:01:22.199 --> 00:01:25.302
THE FIRST.

00:01:22.732 --> 00:01:26.436
WE HAD A BIG ONE LAST YEAR

00:01:25.435 --> 00:01:27.971
REGARDING A LITTLE BOY THAT

00:01:26.570 --> 00:01:28.705
WANTED TO GO TO AMERICA FOR

00:01:28.104 --> 00:01:31.274
TREATMENT, TREATMENT THAT WAS

00:01:28.839 --> 00:01:34.344
NOT AVAILABLE IN THE U.K.

00:01:31.408 --> 00:01:35.779
IN THIS CASE, FOR YOUNG ALFIE,

00:01:34.478 --> 00:01:36.646
THE TREATMENT WAS AVAILABLE IN

00:01:35.912 --> 00:01:38.448
ITALY BUT NOT HERE.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:41.685
THE LITTLE BOY IS SICK.

00:01:38.582 --> 00:01:44.521
BUT ANY PARENTS, ANY PARENT IN

00:01:41.818 --> 00:01:46.923
THE WORLD WHO HAS A CHILD THAT

00:01:44.654 --> 00:01:48.525
IS SICK WOULD MOVE HEAVEN AND

00:01:47.057 --> 00:01:50.360
EARTH IF SOMEBODY ELSE COULD

00:01:48.658 --> 00:01:50.727
OFFER THEM A DIFFERENT

00:01:50.494 --> 00:01:54.164
TREATMENT.

00:01:50.861 --> 00:01:57.434
YET WHAT HAPPENS HERE IS OUR

00:01:54.297 --> 00:01:59.169
STATE-RUN MEDICAL SYSTEM DECIDES

00:01:57.567 --> 00:02:01.037
THERE'S NOTHING ELSE THAT CAN BE

00:01:59.302 --> 00:02:02.706
DONE AND BACKED UP BY STATE

00:02:01.171 --> 00:02:05.809
COURTS, THEY MAKE A DECISION

00:02:02.839 --> 00:02:08.478
THAT THOSE PARENTS ARE NOT FIT

00:02:05.942 --> 00:02:08.778
TO MOVE THEIR CHILD SOMEWHERE

00:02:08.612 --> 00:02:12.849
ELSE.

00:02:08.912 --> 00:02:14.317
THE POPE HAS INTERVENED, THE

00:02:12.983 --> 00:02:15.585
PRESIDENT OF ITALY GRANTED HIM

